message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TRI-X-CDSS: Integration Package for the TRI-X Clinical Triage Framework"
abstract: >-
  An installable Python package that wires the TRI-X decision components --
  triage, TiTrATE, governance, dynamic risk staging and routing -- into one
  import surface, with a worked patient-level example that exercises the
  components together.
